  {
   "id": "sch_rec",
   "title": {
    "en": "Movement schedule: Trade receivables (LS-REC)",
    "ar": "جدول الحركة: Trade receivables (LS-REC)"
   },
   "fields": [
    {
     "id": "sch_rec",
     "label": {
      "en": "Trade receivables movement schedule",
      "ar": "جدول حركة Trade receivables"
     },
     "type": "table",
     "required": false,
     "columns": [
      {
       "id": "component",
       "label": {
        "en": "Component",
        "ar": "المكوّن"
       },
       "type": "select",
       "required": true,
       "options": [
        {
         "value": "gross_receivables",
         "label": {
          "en": "Gross receivables",
          "ar": "المدينون الإجماليون"
         }
        },
        {
         "value": "loss_allowance",
         "label": {
          "en": "Loss allowance",
          "ar": "مخصص الخسائر الائتمانية"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "opening",
       "label": {
        "en": "Opening balance",
        "ar": "الرصيد الافتتاحي"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": true
      },
      {
       "id": "additions",
       "label": {
        "en": "Invoiced",
        "ar": "المفوتر"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "disposals",
       "label": {
        "en": "Collected",
        "ar": "المحصل"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "transfers",
       "label": {
        "en": "Transfers and reclassifications",
        "ar": "التحويلات وإعادة التبويب"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "revaluation",
       "label": {
        "en": "Revaluation or remeasurement",
        "ar": "إعادة التقييم أو إعادة القياس"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "other",
       "label": {
        "en": "Written off and allowance movements",
        "ar": "المشطوب وحركة المخصص"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "closing",
       "label": {
        "en": "Closing balance",
        "ar": "الرصيد الختامي"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": true
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "sch_rec_difference",
     "label": {
      "en": "Difference between the closing total and the leadsheet",
      "ar": "الفرق بين الإجمالي الختامي والورقة الرئيسية"
     },
     "type": "money",
     "required": false,
     "autofill": "paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-REC.difference",
     "readonly": true
    },
    {
     "id": "sch_rec_agrees",
     "label": {
      "en": "Schedule agrees to the leadsheet",
      "ar": "الجدول يتفق مع الورقة الرئيسية"
     },
     "type": "text",
     "required": false,
     "autofill": "paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-REC.agrees",
     "readonly": true
    },
    {
     "id": "sch_rec_opening_difference",
     "label": {
      "en": "Difference between the opening total and the prior period",
      "ar": "الفرق بين الإجمالي الافتتاحي والفترة السابقة"
     },
     "type": "money",
     "required": false,
     "autofill": "paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-REC.opening_difference",
     "readonly": true
    }
   ],
   "note": {
    "en": "Gross receivables and the loss allowance reconciled from the opening to the closing balance. Required by IFRS 7.35H and 7.35I. Closing balance = opening + additions - disposals + transfers + revaluation + other for every component; Loss allowance is stated positive and deducted. The closing total must equal the adjusted balance of Trade and other receivables (LS-REC) read above; the paper computes the schedule and shows the difference.",
    "ar": "يشترطه IFRS 7.35H and 7.35I. الرصيد الختامي = الافتتاحي + الإضافات - الاستبعادات + التحويلات + إعادة التقييم + أخرى لكل مكوّن؛ ويُذكر المكوّن المقابل موجباً ويُخصم. يجب أن يساوي الإجمالي الختامي الرصيد المعدّل لـ Trade and other receivables (LS-REC) المقروء أعلاه؛ وتحسب الورقة الجدول وتعرض الفرق."
   }
  }
